Just remember.
it's not over till it's over. fat boy.

101
00:07:40.209 --> 00:07:42.370
Oh. now. wait a minute. Tim.

102
00:07:42.445 --> 00:07:46.404
Let's be professional about this.
This is for charity. It's for the children.

103
00:07:46.482 --> 00:07:50.919
The least you can do
is wear your little elf hat.

104
00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:56.820
<i>Remember. Tim.
to make the snow machine work</i>

105
00:07:56.893 --> 00:07:59.384
<i>you just hit that button
on the back of the sled.</i>

106
00:07:59.462 --> 00:08:02.898
Yes. Maureen. I remember.
I'm the one that designed it. Do you recall?

107
00:08:02.965 --> 00:08:06.298
