111
00:08:36.966 --> 00:08:41.460
Join me. Santa. and Tim "The... "
"The Elf Man" Taylor

112
00:08:41.537 --> 00:08:44.370
for a very special <i>Christmas Tool Time.</i>

113
00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.772
We'll be kicking off our...

114
00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.338
We'll be kicking off
